    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">内容</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Leina_Vance:_The_Exiled_Warrior\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">蕾娜·万斯：流亡战士</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Strategy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">策略</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Vs._Leina\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">对战蕾娜</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Overall_Judgement\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">总体评价</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#On_Leina_3D\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">关于蕾娜3D</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Leina_Vance:_The_Exiled_Warrior\">蕾娜·万斯：流亡战士</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLeina_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/9a/Leina_GB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130630053316\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Leina GB\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/9a/Leina_GB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130630053316\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"256\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Leina GB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Leina_GB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Leina_GB.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>BP：12</li>\n<li>身高：4</li>\n<li>攻击：1</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p><p>《女皇之刃》的主要「女主角」，也是发布的第一本书，  <a href=\"/wiki/Leina_Vance\" title=\"Leina Vance\">蕾娜</a>  类似战斗之书中的‘Ryu’，具有良好的基础、扎实的基本功和全面的选项。她善用盾牌战斗，是少数拥有大量‘虚招’的角色之一，能攻击她通常会被颜色阻挡的区域。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Strategy\">策略</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLeina_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4e/QB_Reina_30.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130630053543\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"QB Reina 30\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4e/QB_Reina_30.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130630053543\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"241\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"QB Reina 30.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QB_Reina_30.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:QB_Reina_30.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>蕾娜如同‘铁壁’，因为她是目前女皇之刃系列中首批书籍里得分页数最低的角色之一。这让她在原始交换中能大部分时间胜出，并能将对手消磨殆尽。这也很好，因为蕾娜的修正值很低(她最强的只有+3，其他多数为0和1)，所以她往往依赖对手的得分页来造成伤害。除了两个额外的虚招外，她没有太多真正的特技。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1f/QB_Reina_21.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130630053539\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"QB Reina 21\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1f/QB_Reina_21.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130630053539\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"239\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"QB Reina 21.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QB_Reina_21.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:QB_Reina_21.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>考虑到这一点，蕾娜玩家在战斗中应该尝试做什么呢？由于蕾娜的修正值不佳，当与同样肉厚的对手战斗时，你的‘跳跃’就成为突破防御所需的额外动力，每次跳跃在下一回合给予你某个特定动作+2(跳向橙色，闪避针对下段和侧砍，下蹲针对蓝色，跳开则对一切+2)。除此之外，你需要学习穿插蕾娜攻击的节奏，以免变得太可预测(突刺禁用侧砍，她的砍击禁用突刺及对应颜色，她的格挡也禁用一种颜色[蓝色对应高处，橙色对应低处])，不过凭借额外的虚招，她能稍微弥补这一弱点。否则就是留意对手的行动，用你的众多选项和工具打断他们的布局，同时尽量减少自身受到的伤害。\n\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vs._Leina\">对战蕾娜</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLeina_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/56/QB_Reina_22.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130630053539\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"QB Reina 22\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"240\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"QB Reina 22.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QB_Reina_22.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/56/QB_Reina_22.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130630053539\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/56/QB_Reina_22.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130630053539\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"QB Reina 22\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/56/QB_Reina_22.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130630053539\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"240\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"QB Reina 22.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QB_Reina_22.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/56/QB_Reina_22.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130630053539\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:QB_Reina_22.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>虽然蕾娜是个不错的坦克，但关于她的几点注意事项使她的玩法比应有的要弱一些。首先，蕾娜没有治疗选项，而且BP只有12，即使你自己几次好的戳击也会开始让她后退。此外，蕾娜的动作意味着她并不总是能处在拦截敌人撤退到长距离的位置，更不用说那些高回避的战斗者了。她自己也难以造成伤害，所以面对另一个坦克时，她开始挣扎，除非她利用跳跃，而这时你必须开始弄清楚那个蕾娜玩家更想要什么，并惩罚他们尝试增强。蕾娜也无法破坏盾牌或武器，这意味着面对那些能破坏的敌人，她的防御选项会相应地变得更加有限。\n\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overall_Judgement\">总体评价</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLeina_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/QB_Reina_24.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130630053540\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"QB Reina 24\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"240\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"QB Reina 24.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QB_Reina_24.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/QB_Reina_24.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130630053540\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/QB_Reina_24.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130630053540\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"QB Reina 24\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/QB_Reina_24.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130630053540\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"240\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"QB Reina 24.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QB_Reina_24.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/QB_Reina_24.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130630053540\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:QB_Reina_24.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>蕾娜的书把她描绘成她系列起步时的「普通」女主角。她很扎实，但没有任何东西让人觉得‘印象深刻’，而且没有治疗，她只能抗打和输出一段时间，然后就会耗尽。尽管如此，在合适的人手中她也能发挥效果，这更多归结于不是她‘缺乏’，而是后来的书在某些方面更‘极端’，使她相形见绌。\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>技能等级：初学者／高级</b></li>\n<li><b>等级：B  </b></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"On_Leina_3D\">关于蕾娜3D</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLeina_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/32/Leina3D_GB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140503155012\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Leina3D GB\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"253\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Leina3D GB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Leina3D_GB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/32/Leina3D_GB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20140503155012\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/32/Leina3D_GB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140503155012\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Leina3D GB\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/32/Leina3D_GB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20140503155012\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"253\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Leina3D GB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Leina3D_GB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/32/Leina3D_GB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20140503155012\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Leina3D_GB.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>BP：10</li>\n<li>身高：4</li>\n<li>攻击：1</li></ul>\n<p>看到这本书吗？避开这本书。它和蕾娜一样，但有更差的SCORE页面，而且BP更少。所以她承受更多伤害，而且总体生命值更少来通过战斗……使用完全相同的攻击和效果！他们甚至没有在这次复刻中给她一个急需的治疗，为了同样的艺术品的3D渲染，整体体验更差。总体而言，这个版本仍然可玩，但你为了不同的美术给自己增加了劣势……\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>技能等级：初学者／高级</b></li></ul>\n<ul><li><b>等级：C</b></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821131632\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node 